# Cloudflare Pages Edge Routing Rules

# 1. Dedicated Portal Workspaces (Bypass Public SPA Router)
/host          /host-portal.html    200
/host/*        /host-portal.html    200
/admin         /admin.html          200
/admin/*       /admin.html          200

# 2. Public Clean URL SPA Fallback
# Serves /, /stays, /stays/:slug, /production, /about, /contact, /trips, /saved, /profile
/*             /index.html          200
